<h1 class="has-font-size-heading">
  Your post has been removed for legal reasons
</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @post.user.rtl_safe_username %>,</p>
<p>
  We're writing to let you know that a <%= link_to 'post you wrote', generic_share_link(@post) %> has been removed
  by our community team for legal reasons.
</p>

<% if @complaint.present? %>
  <p>
    This removal was necessary because of our legal obligations under the Online Safety Act, because we believe the
    content may be related to <%= content_type(@complaint.content_type)['name'].downcase %>.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can <%= link_to 'view the details of the report here', complaint_url(@complaint.access_token,
                                                                             host: @post.community.host) %>.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  If you believe this removal was in error, you may <%= link_to 'start an appeal',
                                                                new_complaint_url(host: @post.community.host) %>.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks for your understanding.<br/>
  <%= SiteSetting['NetworkName'] %> Community Team
</p>
